      <h3 id="text3">CURATOR</h3>
    </div>

    <div id="processCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="false" data-bs-interval="false">

    
      <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#processCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
        <img src="/photos/sageleaf.jpg" class="sageleaf sage-left" alt="leaf">
    </button>
    
    <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#processCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
        <img src="/photos/sageleaf.jpg" class="sageleaf sage-right" alt="leaf">
    </button>
      <div class="carousel-inner">
    
      
        <div class="carousel-item active">
          <div class="process-slide centered">
            <div class="step three-col">
              <div class="left-col">
              <h3>After months of planning, all we are left with are memories.</h3></div>
              <div class="middle-col">
                <img src="/photos/sagemiddle.png" alt="decorative vine" class="vine-divider">
              </div>
              <div class="right-col">
              <br><p>It is the emotions of your day that stay with you forever – not the guest lists that kept you up at 3am, centerpieces that you spent hours thinking about, and definitely not the things that fade.<br><br>
    
              The look your mom gives you because she sees her baby getting married.<br>
              Your partner catches your eye with that “we’re really married” feeling.<br>
              The breakdancing your best friend commits to on the dancefloor.<br>
              Your dad watching you start a new chapter of your life.<br><br>
    
              I’m here to document that story: the chaos, the softness, the tears, and all the in-between.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    
      
        <div class="carousel-item">
          <div class="process-slide centered">
            <div class="step three-col">
              <div class="left-col">
              <h3>You must <br>be thinking,<br> “my cousin can do the same job.”</h3></div>
              <div class="middle-col">
                <img src="/photos/sagemiddle.png" alt="decorative vine" class="vine-divider">
              </div>
              <div class="right-col">
              <p>Sure, but I do so much more than hitting record. Why wouldn’t you want your big day captured with the same love you put into it? Sure, your cousin might be able to step in, but will they be fully present? Will they know what moments to anticipate? And what about the ones they miss? The ones you’ll never even know happened?<br><br>
    
              You’re not just investing in the hours I’m there on your wedding day; you’re investing in memories that your kids will one day watch.<br>
    
              Someday, when you’re lying in bed at 2am replaying your day, giggling at the chaos, and tearing up at speeches, you’ll know exactly why having it all documented mattered.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <section class="about">
      <div class="about-img">
        <img src="/photos/photoabout.jpg" alt="Mehak with camera">
      </div>
    
      <div class="about-text">
        
        <p>
          <h2> Meet Mehak Sekhon</h2>
          <p>Your fav third wheel & hype woman </p>
          A little bit about me, I’ve always loved the real parts of life. I’m a huge empath, so you’ll definitely see me heavily blinking during a doli. When I’m not capturing emotions, I’m studying them. I LOVE spending time with my family, friends, and especially my dog, Bruno. One of my favourite things in the world is travelling!!
<br><br><br>
<h2>Why me?</h2>
I’m a firm believer that everyone deserves a personal hype woman. Someone that laughs with you, fixes your hair, straightens your outfit, grabs you coffee, & makes you truly feel like the star of the show. I love love (genuinely) and nothing makes me happier than witnessing two people be cute. If there’s a fan club for your relationship, just know that I’m the president.



         
        </p>
       
      </div>
    </section>

